# NOTE ON THE SIGNING KEY
# keys/v2_signing_rsa2048.pem is committed deliberately. It is the MCUboot
# signing key for the "v2" hardware batch: keeping it in version control means
# it cannot be lost, at the cost of anyone who can read this repository being
# able to sign an image the bootloader will accept. That trade is intentional
# for this project — the tags display public data and carry no secrets. Do not
# copy this arrangement into anything where firmware authenticity matters;
# generate the key with `make v2-genkey` and keep it offline instead.
